OL,3,GNEWSAStudents across South West receive
OL,4,AGCSE results
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wait is over for thousands of
OL,7,Fstudents receiving their GCSE or
OL,8,Fequivalent results across Devon and
OL,9,FCornwall.
OL,11,FA total of 67.3% of all grades across
OL,12,FEngland, Wales and Northern Ireland
OL,13,Fthis year were marked at 4/C and above
OL,14,F- down slightly on the 67.4% last year.
OL,16,FAmong those celebrating was Tor Bridge
OL,17,FHigh in Devon, which saw a record year
OL,18,Ffor scores including double the number
OL,19,Fof top 7+ grades.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
